From 2e20bbba11e3f6b652c9fcf07b82b95d37a59fdd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 22:34:57 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(ui): ask to save unsaved changes before close, New and
 Open

The command history now records its position at the last save or load
(History::mark_clean / History::is_dirty): the document is dirty when
the position differs, so undoing back to the saved point is clean again
and a redo past it is dirty again; a new command over a saved point on
the redo stack makes it unreachable. Ephemeral state never dirties it.

The window title leads with '*' while dirty. The window X now queues a
Quit like Ctrl+Q; Quit, New and Open (dialog) over a dirty document are
held and an egui Modal asks Save / Don't Save / Cancel, answered through
the queue (CommandKind::ResolveUnsaved). A cancelled or failed save
keeps the document and the app open.

Fixes #107

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
